imbh-c provides CMake targets:

    find_package(imbh-c CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE imbh-c::imbh-c)

Then include the C or C++ API:

    #include <imbh.h>     // C ABI
    #include <imbh.hpp>   // header-only C++ RAII wrapper

Query results cross the boundary zero-copy as an Arrow C Data Interface
`struct ArrowArrayStream` (imbh.h pulls in <arrow/c/abi.h>; a vendored copy ships
with this package, and a consumer that also installs `arrow` picks up theirs).
